{"title":"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems\">2003 AMC 12B #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">2003 AMC 10B #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Al gets the disease algebritis and must take one green pill and one pink pill each day for two weeks. A green pill costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3b9e046c83ca25ffa3c15f213a16571b36a47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a pink pill, and Al's pills cost a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/7/f776ec2c31ad3dc4b571f7f249f3cf07ccff05a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 546$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> for the two weeks. How much does one green pill cost?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/153bfccea757dcfef7b57d1ed10bbcb4836ddd10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\textdollar 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\textdollar 14 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\textdollar 19\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\textdollar 20\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\textdollar 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"433\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days in two weeks, Al spends <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de7b3f78e24de5b8f22a3ab5b7aecfd6401bd8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$546/14 = 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> dollars per day for the cost of a green pill and a pink pill. If the green pill costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> dollars and the pink pill <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> dollars, the sum of the two costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5aed851e97f2f89b7ceeb6d5424aac270f956a73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> should equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e058d401a1b942f106f081ff1fcca8a8b1d42a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$39$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> dollars. Then the cost of the green pill <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/f/75f3795f8b392b98ab90ac4e5cf6ac72161c85e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }\\textdollar  20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"75\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> cost of a green pill and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d23e766054bc2ff2fde06a8b71bac35986b6c168.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> cost of a pink pill. A week has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e9993a3622c754324be3257853b1c5aef889ae4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\cdot 2 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> days, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/2/da229fec2e493b12a582630d9cb8686759d4aeb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14g + 14g - 14 = 546 \\implies 28g = 560 \\implies g = \\boxed{\\textdollar 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"421\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation (2026 AMC 10 Prep Mock 6-2)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B\">2003 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-s